Package: CoReview
Title: Streamline Human Checking and Updating of AI Data Extraction and
    Quality Appraisals for Health Economic Evaluation Literature Reviews
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mengmeng", "Wang", , "mengmeng.wang@orygen.org.au", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5486-4208")),
    person("Matthew", "Hamilton", , "matthew.hamilton1@monash.edu", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7407-9194"))
  )
Description: A work in progress library that launches a Shiny user
    interface designed for human reviewers who are undertaking AI assisted
    literature reviews of health economic evaluation studies. This
    software has been made publicly available as part of the process for
    testing and documenting the library. It should be regarded as
    experimental and is not currently recommended for use beyond members
    of the development team.
